'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Grok发布7分钟AI版《奥德赛》短片，正式进军长篇叙事影视领域</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Block发布全新语音模型Dessa，实现本地部署与全双工情感交互</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">联想发布AI主机P7预览版：搭载国产双芯，支持本地运行122B大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5ea1340f01d9f4107ebc32456719f07b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">10月25日，联想AI主机P7预览版正式亮相。该设备重量仅300克，采用国产双芯架构，一颗芯片负责AI推理，另一颗负责系统调度。性能方面，P7支持本地运行最高122B参数大模型，具备256K超长上下文处理能力，断网状态下推理速度达50Tokens/秒，满载功耗低于30W，运行噪音低于35dBA。软件层面，内置联想天禧AI，支持开箱即用及Agent配置，并具备Auto模式，可根据任务复杂度智能调度本地与云端算力。该主机旨在解决云端AI调用中的隐私泄露、高昂费用及网络不稳定等痛点，实现数据本地化处理。目前，联想已启动“先享计划”，邀请首批用户在编程与办公场景中进行深度试用与共创，以进一步优化产品体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">猫王版权方起诉Anthropic索赔4100万美元，指控Claude模型非法训练</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ca966cf5e5c71fe3981b4ab8175d3235.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">猫王埃尔维斯·普雷斯利音乐曲库持有方Authentic Brands Group正式向Anthropic提起诉讼，指控其未经许可使用274首猫王经典歌曲训练Claude模型，索赔总额达4100万美元。原告方首席律师理查德·布施指出，Anthropic的商业模式建立在规模化版权侵权之上，Claude模型能生成包括《情不自禁爱上你》等经典曲目的侵权内容。原告要求按每首曲目15万美元的标准赔付，并指控Anthropic在明知防护机制无效的情况下仍放任模型产出侵权内容，存在主观恶意。此案是知名艺人遗产管理方直接针对AI开发公司发起的重大诉讼，其判决结果将为AI企业合法使用音乐曲库划定法律判例标准。当前AI音乐平台通过分析海量作品学习音色与结构，引发了音乐界对版权侵权及AI生成内容替代人类原创的广泛担忧。此前Spotif</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Grok发布7分钟AI版《奥德赛》短片，正式进军长篇叙事影视领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/131bb79930c05728cd31b0ad70cf3783.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Grok近日正式公开时长约7分钟的《奥德赛》系列首集短片，标志着马斯克此前宣布的AI电影项目取得实质性进展。该项目由Grok与Wonder Studios及导演Dev Walker合作完成，全片的人物形象、场景搭建及海上航行等视觉画面均由AI算法生成。此次发布被视为对标克里斯托弗·诺兰版《奥德赛》的尝试，旨在验证生成式AI独立承担大规模影视创作的能力。从样片看，AI生成的海洋场景和人物拟真度较高，但在人物魅力、情感张力及叙事节奏上与传统电影仍存差距。业内分析认为，该短片的核心价值在于展示了生成式AI向长篇叙事影视内容迈出的关键一步，未来AI能否产出具备商业竞争力的电影作品，已成为影视与科技界关注的焦点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Block发布全新语音模型Dessa，实现本地部署与全双工情感交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/49f125bc8c3dbb51e113e278c27e3d02.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Block公司于2026年10月24日正式发布全新语音模型Dessa。该模型采用语音转语音架构，完全基于人类语音数据训练，无需依赖LLM进行知识检索，支持本地部署。Dessa具备全双工交互能力，可同时进行聆听与对话，并能模拟笑声、停顿、哭泣等丰富情感，有效解决了传统文本驱动模型语境缺失的痛点。在硬件适配方面，Dessa可在搭载MacBook M4 Max的消费级设备或单台NVIDIA GPU机架上高效运行。目前，Block已邀请安全研究人员对该模型进行首批测试，以评估其应用表现。作为金融科技公司，Block此次布局旨在通过低成本、高拟真的本地化语音AI，提升企业订单处理等场景的交互体验，标志着语音AI正加速向原生语音交互阶段演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
